ucc y\\succ x$ matters; payoffs $(0,1,2)$ give exactly the same choices.","Lowering $v(z)$ from $10$ to $2$ would change whether the agent prefers $z$ to $y$.","Since $10>0+1$, the agent prefers $z$ to having both $x$ and $y$."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"38d625d2017a5e34d7ef5fac","time_limit":60,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"replaced_after_academic_review"}]}}